# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Also set this in the deploy host's environment
# settings, or the production build ships without analytics.
#
# The PostHog project API key is public by design — the site is static output
# with no server runtime, so the value ends up in the client bundle either way.
# It is the write-only ingestion key (`phc_…`) from Project settings → Project
# ID; the personal API key (`phx_…`) is a different, secret thing and never
# belongs in here.
PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
